    <section class="panel" role="region" id="panel-influencer" aria-labelledby="tab-influencer" tabindex="0" hidden>
      <GimmickPlay tab="influencer">
        <p slot="intro">Want a taste of the treadmill? Post away. Each post costs one energy bar, and one bar refills every second. Open “Under the hood” to see which trick is working on you as it happens.</p>
      </GimmickPlay>
