    <section class="panel" role="region" id="panel-cooking" aria-labelledby="tab-cooking" tabindex="0" hidden>
      <Sections data={cooking} id="cooking" slots={1} empty="Recipes and kitchen adventures are on their way." photoAlt={(t) => `Cooking: ${t}`} />
    </section>

    <section class="panel" role="region" id="panel-musician" aria-labelledby="tab-musician" tabindex="0" hidden>
      <GimmickPlay tab="musician" />
      <LinksMenu id="musician-links" toggle="external" items={[{ links: musicianLinks }]} />
      <div class="story">
        <p>
          I've always been fascinated by creating music. But not only am I tone deaf, I also struggle with reading sheet music,
          and even with something as simple as <a href="https://www.image-line.com/fl-studio/">FL Studio</a> and
          <a href="https://www.virtualdj.com/">VirtualDJ</a>. I remember messing with them a lot, but never making progress, or
          just making utter terrible shit. All I've been able to do by myself is fade songs in and out, fix their EQ and such in
          <a href="https://www.audacityteam.org/">Audacity</a>. Never true music creation.
        </p>
        <p>
          I can keep a beat, though, which is why I want to get into drumming one day! Why not now? Because of priorities, and
          there's only so much I can cook at one time... So it's planned out on my backlog! I want to play
          <i>World's End Dancehall</i>, <i>Two-Faced Lovers</i> and <i>Sweet Devil</i> on drums!
        </p>
        <p>Meanwhile, I can use AI to turn random, interesting ideas into fun songs! Just like anyone else! 🥳</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="panel" role="region" id="panel-painting" aria-labelledby="tab-painting" tabindex="0" hidden>
      <GimmickPlay tab="painting" />
      <div class="story">
        <p>
          Definitely I do not have enough dexterity to really get where I want in terms of this skill as I've approach my natural
          upper limit in this skill, but fortunately I know the right people with the skills to help transform my ideas into reality. Regardless, I still push myself to at least try!
        </p>
      </div>
      <PhotoGrid photos={painting} name="painting" caption="date" empty="Paintings and drawings are on their way." />
    </section>

